    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DungeonGOGO</strong> is a challenging precision platformer where you escape from the Light Prison and rescue your friends from hidden chambers.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and uncover all the secret rooms to set your friends free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimalistic graphics</strong> for a clean and focused experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Highly challenging gameplay</strong> that will test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>40 levels</strong> and <strong>20 secrets</strong> to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full <strong>controller support</strong> for an immersive playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is hardcore\u2014try not to break your controller! \ud83d\ude42</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you see this symbol:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700610/extras/5ae44ad8a666da6a9475c9404c89fce2.avif?t=1735487726\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a closer look\u2014there\u2019s a secret nearby...</p>",
